          desc: 'Targeting high-intent booking search queries and protecting your property branded keywords against aggressive OTA bidding.'
        },
        {
          title: 'Performance Max for Hospitality',
          desc: 'Data-driven travel PMax campaigns utilizing Google machine learning across YouTube, Maps, Search, and Display.'
        },
        {
