        {
          q: 'What makes Alpha Digital different from other Google Ads agencies?',
          a: 'Founder Daniel Santoso brings 9 years of hands-on Google Ads expertise in Bali hospitality, certified in Google Ads Search and Digital Marketing, backed by server-side GA4 tracking.'
